        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) If an employee seeking Career Placement refuses a job offer which matches a request he/she has made, then that request is canceled; and it, or any other request for the same title and grade/wage level and location, may not be resubmitted for a period of four (4) months from the date of refusal.",
