            "block_content": "(6) When an employee accepts a job offer made under the LTP, all other requests on file shall be canceled and the employee may not submit any new Career Placement Requests until the applicable Time-in-Title and Grade and Time-in-Location requirement(s) for the position to be filled have been met.",
